msgstr "Cover shadow colour"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:3020
msgid "Color of the drop shadow behind book covers and folder cards. Has no effect where the shadow is switched off. Default mid gray, and darker in night mode."
msgstr "Colour of the drop shadow behind book covers and folder cards. Has no effect where the shadow is switched off. Default mid grey, and darker in night mode."

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:3037 lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:3042
